            "text": "Based on the historical climate data, Sydney is the clear and recommended choice. The city's mild winter weather provides a comfortable and safer environment for an individual managing heat-induced asthma. A trip to Tokyo in July would require careful management, extensive time in air-conditioned environments, and a robust asthma action plan."
